3
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:08.844 line:15%
President Trump has, on multiple occasions,

4
00:00:08.844 --> 00:00:11.200 line:15%
brought up the idea of buying Greenland

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.270 line:15%
from the Danish government.

6
00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:15.930 line:15%
So Michael, how serious do you think this idea might be?

7
00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:17.490 line:15%
It's quite serious actually.

8
00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.300
[Reporter] Donald Trump trying to purchase

9
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:23.310
what is basically a semi-autonomous region from Denmark,

10
00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:25.840
and now the government of Greenland issues this response,

11
00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.780
saying, hey, we're not for sale.

12
00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:33.140
Saying it's not for sale is the classic opening gambit.

13
00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:35.115
And as the elder statesman of late night,

14
00:00:35.115 --> 00:00:37.864
