15
00:00:37.864 --> 00:00:39.930
I have as much, if not more,

16
00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:41.577
negotiating experience as Trump.

17
00:00:41.577 --> 00:00:45.133
I mean, come on, an 11 o'clock time slot on TBS?

18
00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:49.019
You don't just get that, ladies and gentlemen.

19
00:00:49.019 --> 00:00:50.260
Tonight, I'm going to get some advice

20
00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:54.020
on buying Greenland from a top real estate team.

21
00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:56.030
I actually went over to Greenland this morning

22
00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:58.610
