31
00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:14.530
And to complete the deal,

32
00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:17.540
I realized I had to travel to Greenland myself.

33
00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:19.170
I'm going to travel to Greenland

34
00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:21.793
