35
00:01:24.381 --> 00:01:28.530
Before I went to Greenland, I had to Google Greenland.

36
00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:30.550
Greenland is a huge territory,

37
00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:32.650
three times larger than Texas,

38
00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:36.100
and 80% of it is covered in ice year-round.

39
00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.580
Vikings and Inuit cultures have called it home,

40
00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:42.960
and since 1814, it's been a territory of the Danish.

41
00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:45.400
Now that I was an expert, the only thing left to do

42
00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:48.610
